  "releaseNotes": "Configuration value codecs and in-place JSON value encoding.\n\n- Harden in-place JSON rewrites against transient Windows file-sharing and lock races.\n- Preserve newer concurrent external writes instead of allowing an older protection snapshot to overwrite them.\n- Keep the reported changed-value count tied to the successful rewrite even when post-write verification temporarily encounters a sharing lock.",
